Source: pepper-sync
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Pepper Sync Maintainers <pepper-sync@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pepper-sync
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser, rclone, systemd
Description: hourly video downloads for a Pepper's Ghost display
 Installs a dedicated service account and a systemd timer to copy videos
 from the rclone remote tinycrypt: to /data/video every hour.
 Remote credentials are supplied separately by the administrator.
